    \ingroup vscodeext-how-to-cpp
    \ingroup vscodeext-how-to-qml
    \ingroup vscodeext-how-to-wasm

    \title Report issues

    To report bugs and add suggestions for improvement to the
    \l {Qt project bug tracker}:

    \list 1
        \li Go to \uicontrol {Command Palette}, and then select
            \uicontrol {Qt: Report an issue} to open the bug tracker.
        \li In \uicontrol {Project}, select \uicontrol {VS Code Extension}.
            \image {qt-project-bug-tracker.webp} {Qt project bug tracker}
        \li In \uicontrol {Issue Type}, select the type of the issue.
        \li Select \uicontrol {Next} to enter details and create the issue.
    \endlist
*/
